{"taskId":"lawn-r5-a-contact_motion","purpose":"树干接地、草根与草叶运动","fields":["reserved","rest_reach","tip_excursion"],"name":"reach_margin","specification":"Implement conservative horizontal clearance after static radius and maximum horizontal wind excursion, in metres: reserved-rest_reach-abs(tip_excursion), retaining negative violations; return -1 if reserved or rest_reach is negative. Assess trunk and root-boundary image evidence and simulation geometry separately. Recommend a grounded deformation law and tests for t=0 no wind offset, positive and negative wind and return to rest; use actual shader and clearance values listed. Do not equate public gust HUD with physical anemometry or infer hidden roots.","evidence":{"sceneSha256":"493b3733f4afb4702b6182c8127160de5903c03f42a3d59cfdf0bd2de60bf55c","sourceRevision":"f03c2df36de4a91a01495c645385a0d58d9b1759","regionMeasurement":"Each ROI fixed in real photograph before R4. Rec.709 luminance of linearized sRGB; adjacent pixels horizontally/vertically. Images are not radiometrically calibrated; ground-only photographic depth is unavailable.","calibration":"Image width 1024 height 768. Geometry scale assumes 3.41m lamp. Camera poses registered.","sources":[{"file":"lib/capture-meadow-layout.ts","committedFileSha256":"51c3b2b4f1fd7d1415ede6214cb35e6d1449508665ecee8ad55f7744f16bf11b","firstLine":6,"lastLine":40,"code":"
export function meadowFringeWeight(x:number,z:number):number {
  const b=meadowCoreBounds;
  const dx=Math.max(b.minX-x,0,x-b.maxX), dz=Math.max(b.minZ-z,0,z-b.maxZ);
  const distance=Math.hypot(dx,dz);
  if(!distance)return 1;
  // Variable outward reach avoids an offset rectangular contour. Use distance
  // to the nearest point on the core so the four corners transition radially.
  const width=8.4+1.55*Math.sin(.125*x+.188*z)+.95*Math.cos(.23*x-.132*z);
  const t=Math.min(1,distance/width);
  return 1-t*t*(3-2*t);
}

type Footprint = readonly [x: number, z: number, radius: number];

